        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">SIGECO Securitization I, LLC is a Delaware limited liability company which is 100% owned by Southern Indiana Gas and Electric Company d/b/a CenterPoint Energy Indiana South ("CEI South"). Per its limited liability company agreement, its ownership is described as a "common interest" which is held 100% by CEI South. IURC Cause No. 45722 authorized the securitization financing activity.</span>
